# Angel of Vitality: "This creature gets +2/+2 as long as you have 25 or more life." On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices a land to Zuran
# Orb: 2 life plus the Angel's 1 (20 -> 23), and the Angel is still a 2/2. Fountain of Youth's 1 plus 1 makes exactly 25 and the
# Angel is a 4/4 (CR 613.4c). On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt takes Bot1 to 22 and the Angel is a 2/2 again: the layers ask
# again as the life total changes (CR 611.3a).

